{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VMVtXp6zqK1792814647.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有機構舉辦越野跑比賽，鼓勵青少年親近大自然。<br/></p><p>比賽在慈雲山沙田坳道舉行，約500名選手參與，當中有選手來自中小學，選手需要完成3.2公里賽事。</p><p><br/>主辦的獅子會表示，希望藉活動令青少年走近大自然，強健體魄及鍛鍊意志。</p><p><br/>賽事分三站，總成績最快的選手，可獲資助遠赴波蘭，參與國際越野跑賽事。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:43.763531+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.356213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:14.538278+00:00","content_hash":"e10fb01f26338f2ec4a158f9f5b186a9ba1f795b4c160b36a23c3d64857fc8c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:43.763531+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}